Hari ini, bakal kutumpahin ke muka lo. Sakit. Kaki lo sakit?

01:01:35.884 --> 01:01:37.386
Sakit.

01:01:49.298 --> 01:01:50.299
Ah, sak

01:02:06.615 --> 01:02:08.650
it.

