01:07:57.068 --> 01:07:59.103
Aku. Aku yang pengen.

01:08:00.304 --> 01:08:01.305
Nah.

01:08:01.539 --> 01:08:02.940
Enak banget.

01:08:08.813 --> 01:08:10.882
Jangan, jangan, jangan, jangan.

01:08:12.950 --> 01:08:13.951
Nah.

01:08:16.587 --> 01:08:17.588
Jangan.

01:08:28.499 --> 01:08:30.535
Belum selesai.

01:08:43.181 --> 01:08:44.515
Buka lebarmu.

01:08:51.723 --> 01:08:52.724
Kubuka.

01:09:00.365 --> 01:09:01.666
Mau kan, ini?

01:09:04.903 --> 01:09:06.004
Kumasukkan ya.

01:09:10.308 --> 01:09:11.309
Nah.

01:09:15.013 --> 01:09:16.014
En-

01:09:29.794 --> 01:09:30.795
ak banget.

01:09:42.974 --> 01:09:43.975
Sialan.

01:09:44.209 --> 01:09:45.443
Meler-meler nih.

01:09:45.777 --> 01:09:47.178
Basah banget.

01:09:48.747 --> 01:09:50.048
Tangan ku jadi ikut kotor kan.

01:09:50.815 --> 01:09:52.951
Maaf.

01:09:53.351 --> 01:09:54.019
Maaf.

01:09:54.319 --> 01:09:55.320
Shinji, maaf.

01:09:56.555 --> 01:09:57.923
Nanti jilat sampai bersih ya.

01:10:16.475 --> 01:10:17.943
Nah.

01:10:18.343 --> 01:10:19.411
Nah. Full power.

01:10:28.520 --> 01:10:30.055
Jangan, jangan, jangan.

01:10:34.326 --> 01:10:35.627
Kencang.

01:10:44.603 --> 01:10:45.637
Masih belum.

01:10:46.271 --> 01:10:48.574
Nah. Gedor gini enggak mempan.

01:10:50.676 --> 01:10:52.110
Meskipun minta berhenti, enggak bakal kuberi.

01:10:57.916 --> 01:10:59.051
Bilang lagi.

01:10:59.751 --> 01:11:00.752
Bilang.

01:11:01.420 --> 01:11:02.754
Bilang enggak boleh.

01:11:04.289 --> 01:11:05.357
Padahal enak banget kan, sekarang.

01:11:06.191 --> 01:11:07.459
Enak.

01:11:22.808 --> 01:11:25.477
Minta supaya aku boleh lebih banyak lagi.

01:11:26.545 --> 01:11:27.646
Enak ya.

01:11:28.647 --> 01:11:31.350
Biarkan aku lebih banyak lagi.

01:11:33.352 --> 01:11:35.287
Biarkan aku lebih banyak lagi.

01:11:35.988 --> 01:11:36.622
Aku mau lagi.

01:11:36.889 --> 01:11:37.890
Mau.

