Apaan nih.

01:12:23.936 --> 01:12:25.771
Ini kan cewek-cewek punya air memek.

01:12:28.407 --> 01:12:30.543
Jadi basah kuyup.

01:12:33.846 --> 01:12:35.481
Bersihin kepalanya.

01:12:42.788 --> 01:12:43.990
Pegang sendiri.

01:12:45.524 --> 01:12:46.526
Sakit.

01:12:59.005 --> 01:13:01.240
Bagian belakangnya juga.

01:13:10.850 --> 01:13:12.318
Basah kuyup.

01:13:21.394 --> 01:13:22.829
Jadi basah kuyup.

01:13:27.433 --> 01:13:28.935
Enak.

01:13:48.488 --> 01:13:51.958
Meimei-chan kan pelacur dagingku.

01:13:54.127 --> 01:13:57.831
Aku pelacur dagingnya Shinji.

01:14:05.438 --> 01:14:09.542
Jangan jangan jangan.

01:14:24.391 --> 01:14:26.326
Jangan jangan jangan. Pelacur daging, bukannya kamu terlalu doyan?

01:14:26.860 --> 01:14:27.861
