01:14:28.795 --> 01:14:30.730
Nancep banget lho.

01:14:37.437 --> 01:14:38.505
Gila ya.

01:14:44.811 --> 01:14:46.313
Bilang dong kalau dimasukin cowok itu enak.

01:14:46.580 --> 01:14:47.747
Dimasukin cowok enak.

01:14:49.349 --> 01:14:50.951
