01:17:07.755 --> 01:17:09.023
Mau diaduk-aduk.

01:17:20.234 --> 01:17:21.469
Ah, jangan.

01:17:21.869 --> 01:17:25.006
Ah, sakit sakit sakit. Sakit sakit.

01:17:25.239 --> 01:18:06.848
Ah, sakit. Kak. Kamu baik-baik saja?

