Un, enak...

01:33:47.260 --> 01:33:48.528
Enak ya, Shin-chan?

01:33:49.596 --> 01:33:51.531
Un, enak...

01:33:55.769 --> 01:33:57.070
Hei, dari tadi nempel terus lho...

01:33:59.039 --> 01:34:01.341
Tunjukin...

01:34:18.826 --> 01:34:20.561
Besar banget...

01:34:41.648 --> 01:34:43.117
Ih, udah tegang banget ya, Shin-chan...

01:34:47.988 --> 01:34:49.156
Hei, ada yang netes lho...

01:35:32.733 --> 01:35:34.101
Kamu suka yang begini?

01:35:34.368 --> 01:35:35.703
Shin-chan...

01:36:21.182 --> 01:36:29.457
Enak banget... Aku tahu, badanmu gemetar... Bagus...

01:36:54.782 --> 01:37:00.255
Cilurit Shin-chan ngeluarin cairan lendir terus lho...

01:37:31.286 --> 01:37:32.787
Enak banget...

01:37:35.890 --> 01:37:36.858
Ahh...

01:38:08.824 --> 01:38:09.825
Shin-chan, suka yang begini?

01:38:21.937 --> 01:38:23.472
Dimakan banget...

01:38:26.642 --> 01:38:27.643
Enak...

01:38:30.779 --> 01:38:31.780
Ahh...

01:38:40.455 --> 01:38:42.691
Udah besar banget lho...

01:38:48.163 --> 01:38:49.698
Ada apa, Shin-chan?

01:38:50.332 --> 01:38:52.901
Enak banget... Enak banget...

01:39:10.919 --> 01:39:11.920
Iya...

01:39:51.694 --> 01:39:52.695
Enak, Shin-chan?

01:39:53.562 --> 01:39:56.198
Enak, banget... Lagi?

