Mau ngewe?

01:40:10.746 --> 01:40:14.750
Mau ngerasain enaknya di dalam aku?

01:40:17.953 --> 01:40:18.954
Mau di dalam...

01:40:20.323 --> 01:40:22.959
Boleh kok, Shin-chan...

01:40:24.393 --> 01:40:30.533
